      "title": "Funnel mapping",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Funnel uses actual DB statuses: **applied** (entry) → reviewed → shortlisted → interviewing → offered → **rejected** / withdrawn. There is no **hired** status in `job_applications` CHECK constraint — add a panel to **job_postings** or HR table when available."
